.DS_Store

# .claude/ is local agent config and stays out of the repo — with one exception.
# The add-speaker skill is not config, it is this repo's only build tool: every
# file under speakers/ and en/speakers/ is generated by its script from
# data/speakers-data.js, so a checkout without it cannot regenerate them (and a
# bug fixed in it would otherwise never reach anyone else). Rules are layered
# because git will not descend into an excluded directory to re-include a child.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/add-speaker/

docs/
resend-config.asp
design-plans/
audit-report.md
CLAUDE.md
_deploy/
